---
title: "Publish authenticated metadata without losing retained state"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Snapshot supplied
  s1: Rejected before retention
  s2: Authority checked
  s3: Checkpoint retained
  s4: Failed, checkpoint retained
  s5: Carrier written, awaiting readback
  s6: Publication confirmed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: reject unauthenticated snapshot
  s0 --> s2: verify independent authority
  s2 --> s1: storage fails closed or reject stale snapshot
  s2 --> s3: retain snapshot under operator lock
  s3 --> s4: carrier write fails
  s3 --> s5: write detached carrier
  s5 --> s4: readback fails or differs
  s5 --> s6: confirm matching authenticated envelope
